{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 140,
    "dDurationMs": 8220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm actually gonna use my arm so I can high-five\nso many people, 106."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8360,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You're gonna high-five 106 people?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10520,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11520,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Aren't you gonna get tired?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12600,
    "dDurationMs": 3459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No, because my robo-arm's going to do all\nthe work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16059,
    "dDurationMs": 1941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Alex was born without a fully formed arm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18000,
    "dDurationMs": 4189,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A condition that affects around 1,500 babies\nborn in the U.S. every year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22189,
    "dDurationMs": 3430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm here to see him get fitted with a new\narm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25619,
    "dDurationMs": 4351,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have come a long way in the development\nof prosthetic limbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29970,
    "dDurationMs": 5170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might think of the earliest prosthetic\nas maybe a peg-leg for a sailor, but it actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35140,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dates back much further than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37050,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, over 3,000 years ago to Ancient Egypt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40260,
    "dDurationMs": 5299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thought was that our lives have a finite\nlength, but that the after-life is eternal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45559,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And according to the theology of Osiris, the\nbody needed to be complete, because the soul"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50359,
    "dDurationMs": 5281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would leave the body, in theory, and every\nnight, come back to replenish its energy in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55640,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56640,
    "dDurationMs": 2759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was so important that that body be\nfull."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59399,
    "dDurationMs": 6991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so there are many instances of prosthetic\nnoses, ears, toes, and limbs, which were used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66390,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Ancient Egypt to ensure that the body was\ncomplete."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69520,
    "dDurationMs": 3279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But a lot of those prosthetics weren't actually\nfunctional."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72799,
    "dDurationMs": 5701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So prosthetics developed from simply being\naesthetic aids to actually becoming functional."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78500,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Globally, there are an estimated 3 million\npeople living without an upper limb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83700,
    "dDurationMs": 5410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the last 10 to 20 years, we've seen remarkable\nadvancement in the development of bionic limbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89110,
    "dDurationMs": 4730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem with these prostheses, is they\ntypically cost on the order of $20,000 to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93840,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "$100,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94840,
    "dDurationMs": 6050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, here at UCF, they're building an arm\nwhich can be used and manufactured for much,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100890,
    "dDurationMs": 3409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "much cheaper, like 1% of that cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104299,
    "dDurationMs": 4081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did you get inspired to design an arm\nfor children?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108380,
    "dDurationMs": 5919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I was on my way to work, and I was listening\nto the radio, and there was an interview with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114299,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the person who developed the first 3D-printed\nhand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116719,
    "dDurationMs": 6260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I went into my research lab and I said\nI have to be a part of this, what can I do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122979,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to help?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123979,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we had Alex's parents contact us\ndirectly saying, \"Can you build our son an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127400,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "arm?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128400,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The arm itself is completely 3D-printed\nand so are the joints between the fingers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132680,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's a cable which runs down the length\nof each finger and back into the hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137420,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They would normally be connected up to this\nservo motor, here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139870,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the idea is to trigger this motor via\nthe arm of the person who's wearing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145030,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they would wear three electrodes on their\nupper arm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148200,
    "dDurationMs": 4369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the person wearing the arm squeezes their\nmuscle, there's a little electrical pulse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152569,
    "dDurationMs": 4181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which triggers this motor to pull in 180 degrees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156750,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One pulse will close the hand, like this,\nand then another pulse will relax it, so it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161950,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "opens back up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162950,
    "dDurationMs": 2819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Our arm provides a level of self-confidence\nto the children."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165769,
    "dDurationMs": 2861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whenever they're going to school there's questions\nasked, like \"what happened to your arm?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168630,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you get bit by a shark or run over by\na car or something?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171040,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After we gave them the arm it quickly changed\nto \"whoa, that's a cool arm!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174240,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How does it work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175240,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where did you get it?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176240,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I like to do stuff with my arm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177240,
    "dDurationMs": 6859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, pick up stuff, hold my paper when I'm\ndrawin' I actually bring it to school so I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184099,
    "dDurationMs": 2251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can actually do other stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186350,
    "dDurationMs": 5389,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- 3D printing is relatively new technology\nbut it provides us a low-cost solution to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191739,
    "dDurationMs": 3871,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be able to create things so we can print something\nout and say, it doesn't work, and just redesign"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195610,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it and print it out again the next day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197019,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We produce our arm for just about $300 now,\nwhereas some of the prosthetics on the market"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201049,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can go upwards of $40,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202970,
    "dDurationMs": 3711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insurance companies typically don't want to\npay for it for kids because every six months,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206681,
    "dDurationMs": 1899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're going to have to replace it as the\nkid grows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208580,
    "dDurationMs": 4510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this allows us to be able to reproduce\nan arm for about maybe $100 and just print"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213090,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out a new one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214090,
    "dDurationMs": 3209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How important is the aesthetic design, the\nartistic design of the arm?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217299,
    "dDurationMs": 4061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We thought kids just wanted to blend in,\nto feel normal, but we found it's much more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221360,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about personal identity and expression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223340,
    "dDurationMs": 3819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We want to make sure the kid is expressing\nhimself, or herself, with the arm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227159,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Self expression for a kid is very important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228839,
    "dDurationMs": 1391,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We have one sleeve right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230230,
    "dDurationMs": 2979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one is actually themed around the Disney\nmovie Tangled, we provided this for a little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233209,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "girl named Madeline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234209,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The design is so simple that it is easy\nto print out on location and put together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238549,
    "dDurationMs": 2131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even with very little technical knowledge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240680,
    "dDurationMs": 4339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And also the functionality of the design,\nwith only three electrodes actuating the one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245019,
    "dDurationMs": 3731,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "servo, make it so that people can learn to\nuse it very quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248750,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that, I think, is what makes it so powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250680,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Think I'll have any luck there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252750,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "50/50?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253750,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- 50/50."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254750,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255750,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Look at that, I can give it to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259320,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260320,
    "dDurationMs": 5230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm really excited right now about trying\nit out, and how to do summersaults, and do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265550,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some things I've never done before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267850,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to play video games with it and hug\nwith two hands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271010,
    "dDurationMs": 4850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How have you been able to crack this problem\nthat other people haven't before?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275860,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We have an incredible team of very diverse\nbackgrounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279930,
    "dDurationMs": 5922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so bringing all of our common experience\ntogether, we were able to find this type of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285852,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286852,
    "dDurationMs": 2408,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our main base is in Orlando, Florida at the\nUniversity of Central Florida."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289260,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have our designers in California, I'm here\nin Germany, and everywhere in between, we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295340,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have people trying to help us and support\nour project."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298180,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Although it's challenging, we're making it\nwork."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299640,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- A lot of our communication comes through\nMicrosoft OneNote, and we use this product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304500,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be able to share information through each\nother, specifically since Albert is in Germany"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308440,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that's a whole ocean away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309950,
    "dDurationMs": 2851,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Albert] I think the best part of OneNote\nis that you can edit it from anywhere in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312801,
    "dDurationMs": 3859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "world and have it simultaneously update anyone\nelse on the project."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316660,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So being able to get updates from my team\nand see the progress they're making, enables"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320310,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "me to help do my job here in Germany."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322520,
    "dDurationMs": 1369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What is the Collective Project?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323889,
    "dDurationMs": 4511,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Microsoft is looking for students who are\nwanting to impact their community with great"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328400,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ideas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329400,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're looking to rally their communities\nand the world around them to help bring it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333071,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334071,
    "dDurationMs": 3149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Our biggest needs right now is one, we need\nfunding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337220,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need more donations to be able to make\nthis a reality and make these children's dreams"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341500,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "come true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342500,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You want to provide free arms to every kid\nwho needs one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345180,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Absolutely, we don't feel like people should\nprofit from a child without an arm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347840,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We're hoping for people that jump on board\nand help develop arms for their local area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352740,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if they want to help with design, they're\nmore than welcome to join our project and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356730,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be designing arms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357730,
    "dDurationMs": 4790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They can be printing our arms, and helping\nfit them for their local community, or they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362520,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can just send us advice on how to best tailor\nthese for the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366490,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can use all the help we can get."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368190,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Where do you want to see the Limbitless\nArm go?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371000,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- My hope for the future is to be able to\nincrease the functionality of the arm to encompass"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375220,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe an elbow or even an upper limb socket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379120,
    "dDurationMs": 5410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then be able to produce this on a larger\nscale for as many children in the world who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384530,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "need it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385530,
    "dDurationMs": 4850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- As each child comes to us, we really understand\nand appreciate the need for the readily adaptable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390380,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "readily deployable solution to each individual\nand unique biology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395090,
    "dDurationMs": 6310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We're trying to get an elbow going for Alex\nso he has not only hand movement but he can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401400,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also move the elbow as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403200,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To overcome that we have to make this also\nbigger to be able to put another servo in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406940,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407940,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We like ideas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408940,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not just, this is our way this is how it has\nto be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411990,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anything's possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412990,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We like to broaden our field as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415950,
    "dDurationMs": 4010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think we're just at the beginning of something\nreally great and I hope that with a little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419960,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bit of help we're going to be able to take\nthis to the UN and UNICEF and really impact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423400,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "children all over the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424840,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Thank you guys for making this big project\nfor me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428050,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's fantastic, thank you so much for\nchatting with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430840,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Thank you!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431980,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Ah, haha, you're very welcome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434830,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video was supported by Microsoft OneNote."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437340,
    "dDurationMs": 4550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In their Collective Project, they have identified\nstudent groups around the country who are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441890,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "working together, using their software in\norder to change the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445360,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the whole point of the Collective Project\nis to bring people together and you can get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448860,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "involved as well by clicking on the link in\nthe description, you could help by providing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453440,
    "dDurationMs": 5330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "new designs for arms, by helping with software\nor even 3D printing in your own community."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458770,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that will help get more of these arms\nout to the kids who need them."
    } ]
  }, {
